### Add a new memory for patient_123
POST http://localhost:8000/api/ingest
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: fortifai-dev-key-2024

{
    "patient_id": "patient_123",
    "raw_text": "Eleanor enjoys listening to Frank Sinatra records in the evening. Her favorite song is 'My Way' which reminds her of Robert's proposal.",
    "source": "family_questionnaire",
    "topic": "hobbies",
    "is_sensitive": false,
    "entities": ["Frank Sinatra", "My Way", "Robert"],
    "emotion": "positive"
}

###

### List memories for patient_123
GET http://localhost:8000/api/dashboard/patients/patient_123/memories?per_page=20

###

### Get memory stats
GET http://localhost:8000/api/dashboard/patients/patient_123/stats

###

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health

###

### Chat with the AI about patient memories
POST http://localhost:8000/api/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: fortifai-dev-key-2024

{
    "patient_id": "patient_123",
    "question": "Tell me about Eleanor's family",
    "include_sensitive": false,
    "limit": 3
}

###

### Ask about hobbies
POST http://localhost:8000/api/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: fortifai-dev-key-2024

{
    "patient_id": "patient_123",
    "question": "What does Eleanor like to do in her free time?",
    "include_sensitive": false,
    "emotion_filter": "positive",
    "limit": 3
}

###

